{"id":487729,"title":"期末测试｜来赴一场满分之约！","content":"<p>你好，我是郭炜。</p><p>咱们的专栏《数据分析思维课》已经结课一段时间了，非常感谢你一直以来的认真学习和支持！</p><p>为了帮你检验自己的学习效果，我特意给你准备了一套结课测试题（可以重复答题）。这套测试题一共有 10 道题（包含单选和多选），考点都来自我们前面讲到的重要知识。</p><p>点击下面按钮开始测试吧！</p><p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=1627&exam_id=4008\"><img src=\"./images/487729_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":377499,"user_name":"杨照东","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":3104381,"ip_address":"河南","ucode":"A8EAE16F0C9440","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epq6QQbdzWkEX3U4XeU2e6ziaV8m1u6siamR986z2ee5pia88R5iblT0WV3ms2K0OGYnYjmzecC1OVOnw/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1688610957,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100084801,"comment_content":"非常优秀的老师","like_count":0}]}